text *Rumble* *Crash*
text Following a big noise, we're now lying down on the ground inside the shed.
sound F1U.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text That was close. A baseball was flying toward you.
text ...So someone really did sell their soul.
text The door must have swung closed. It's pitch black inside.
text And Tomoyo is still on top of me.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text So, the crisis is over, right?
sound F1V.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I think so...
text Her voice is right next to my ear.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then... why are you still on top of me?
sound F1W.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I can't get off even if I want to...
text @[Tomoya]
text Why...?
sound F1X.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text There's something heavy against my back...
text @[Tomoya]
text That's it? It should be a piece of cake for you to push it back and stand up.
sound F1Y.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text It's really heavy... Don't talk like it's an easy thing to do...
text Just as she says that, she lets out a groan.
text @[Tomoya]
text Did you get hurt somewhere...?
sound F1Z.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes... It seems so...
text @[Tomoya]
text Is that why you can't move now...?
sound F20.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes...
text This must be the devil's doing after all.
music BGM08D.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Are you okay...?
sound F21.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Yes...
text The two of us can only keep lying on top of one another in the dark.
text Actually, due to the weight on her back, our embrace has gotten so tight that it's to the point of being uncomfortable.
text @[Tomoya]
text (This is all my fault...)
text @[Tomoya]
text (Argh... Now's not the time for self-loathing...)
text I have to do something.
text @[Tomoya]
text So... Then I'll try to move.
sound F22.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Ah... yeah... please...
text But in this position, I can't put any strength into my limbs.
text Even so, I somehow manage to force my knees up and push against the ground with my heels.
text *Rub*
text I can feel my knees trailing against the softest thing ever.
sound F23.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Haah...
text Tomoyo lets out a deep sigh.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm going to move again.
sound F24.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text O-Okay...
text *Ruuub*
text *Bong*
text My head just hit something hard.
sound F25.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Are you okay...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text But there doesn't seem to be any way to slip out from the top...
sound F26.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I see...
text @[Tomoya]
text This time, I'll try to go from the bottom...
sound F27.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...Yeah... That seems to be the only way...
text *Ruuub*
text @[Tomoya]
text Haah... No good... It's too hard to move this way...
sound F28.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I see...
text Now we're back to our beginning position.
sound F29.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Haah...
text Sweat starts to form at the points where our bodies are touching. Those parts of us feel twice as hot.
text No matter where I turn my head, I can't help sniffing Tomoyo's hair every time I take a breath.
text Even the slightest thought of her is going to transfer more heat to my lower body...
text But I can't afford to let any funny physiological phenomena happen now...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ugh...
sound F2A.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Are you okay...?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, the one just now was different...
sound F2B.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...?
sound F2C.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Then, let's try this...
sound F2D.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I'm going to try to push it up...
sound F2E.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text When I do that, you try to get out...
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh? How about you?
sound F2F.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Well...
sound F2G.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text After you've gotten out, try to drag me out of this mess...
text @[Tomoya]
text Idiot... As if I could do something like that.
sound F2H.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Why...?
text @[Tomoya]
text First you saved me from that ball, and now you want to be under this mess alone...
text @[Tomoya]
text Dragging you out of here?
text @[Tomoya]
text That's just too much...
sound F2I.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text @It's fine that way...
delay 177
text as long as you can be freed from this horrible situation...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's not horrible...
text @[Tomoya]
text In fact, it's not bad at all...
sound F2J.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Really...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah...
text @[Tomoya]
text That's why you don't have to do anything reckless.
sound F2K.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Okazaki, you're really kind, aren't you...?
sound F2L.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text ...
sound F2M.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text I feel like I'm falling for you now...
text Along with her whisper, her warm breath softly touches my ear.
text My heart is beating louder and louder.
text If the spell yesterday was really effective...
text Doesn't that mean she likes me...?
sound F2N.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Say, Okazaki...
text If it goes on like this, I'm going to...
text No, this is bad.
text Not to mention, this situation is just something arranged by that spell...
sound F2O.aac
text @[Tomoyo]
text Okazaki, what do you think... about...
text This is not fair... Not good at all...
text I wrack my brain trying to think of a way to get out of here.
text Ah...
text That's right. Before coming here, I heard from Miyazawa about a method to neutralize the spell...
text What did she say again...?
text I try to remember her words.
